Orchard Commander: licenses of the Rust crates it is built from
================================================================

Orchard Commander is built from the Rust crates listed below. Each license
text is followed by the crates (name and version) that use it. Generated with
cargo-about from Cargo.lock by scripts/third-party-licenses.sh; do not edit by
hand.

The licenses of the bundled C/C++ libraries (FFmpeg, PDFium, UnRAR) are in
the other files of this folder.

